{"seq":3,"slug":"beyond-management","title":"Beyond Management","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/core-contributions/beyond-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-social-ecologist","title":"社会生态学家","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/core-contributions/beyond-management/a-social-ecologist","wordCount":1647,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-functioning-society","title":"正常运转的社会","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/core-contributions/beyond-management/the-functioning-society","wordCount":1718,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现德鲁克超越管理的思想。德鲁克本人更愿意将自己称为一位\"社会生态学家\"——他的视野远超越狭义的管理，致力于观察、理解社会的结构、变迁与运转，贯穿着深厚的人文关怀。他毕生思考的根本问题，是如何构建一个\"正常运转的、维护人之自由与尊严的社会\"；正是这一关切，引导他走向了对组织与管理的研究，并赋予管理以崇高的社会使命。本章揭示德鲁克思想之博大与深刻。\n"}